WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
After you submit the form. we review your application.
Business accounts check next business day.
Personal accounts activate right away.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:17.000
An activation email goes to your inbox.
Open it. Click the link. Your mailbox opens.

3
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Your mailing address is 7554 Fredle Drive.
PMB 456. Concord Township.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:35.000
A welcome email follows.
It confirms your address. It lists office hours.
It reminds you to bring ID. Print it or save it.

5
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Mail arrives. Packages arrive. We sign for carriers.
We note each item. Everything stays secure until you arrive.

6
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Stop by during open hours.
Show your ID. Collect your mail.

7
00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Use the address now.
Put it on bills. List it for online orders.
Forward old mail here.

8
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:10.000
That's the process.
Shipping shouldn't cost you an hour.
